  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Welcome to a realm where life is woven from starlight and crystalline
    pulses. Here, floating sanctuaries of moon-marble drift through nebulous skies,
    and every spark reveals hidden wonders pulsing with cosmic rhythm.\nIn Hologel
    World, you\u2019ll nurture sentient orbs of pure energy\u2014Hologels\u2014by
    merging identical creatures into ever-brighter forms. Each fusion unlocks richer
    shapes, personalities, and curious abilities that dance across your infinite
    canvas.\nTrade flowing energy conduits for astral shards, solve merge puzzles
    powered by celestial alignment, and uncover relics buried in nebula glass that
    whisper ancient secrets.\nManage your vault of stardust orbs to unlock ten enchanting
    tales, harvest relics to expand your trove, and cultivate a constellation of
    Hologel champions that glow with purpose.\nWhether you\u2019re a strategist plotting
    the perfect merge chain, a collector hunting rare forms, or a lore-lover diving
    into radiant stories\u2014this universe welcomes you with a burst of light. The
    cosmos calls. Are you ready to ignite the flow?\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
